// 04 - dataApi calls: volume, failures and p95 duration.
//
// Run this BEFORE filtering on `type`. The docs do not list the `type` value used for
// dataApi operations, and Dataverse's own server-side calls also land in dependencies.
// Let the first run tell you which value belongs to your page, then add:
//   | where type == "<value you found>"
//
// tobool(success): in the legacy `dependencies` table `success` is documented as a
// STRING (it is a bool only in the workspace table AppDependencies), so a bare
// `success == false` compares a string with a bool. tobool() is correct for both.
// https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/azure-monitor/app/apm-tables
dependencies
| where timestamp > ago(7d)
| where cloud_RoleInstance == "CDS Data Export"
| summarize calls = count(), failed = countif(tobool(success) == false), p95 = percentile(duration, 95) by type, name
| order by p95 desc
